flowchart TB
    accTitle: Which job of a Nextcloud app holds which secret
    accDescr: The release workflow enters no environment and passes the build only the name of the key. The build enters the environment signing, which holds the key that signs the app and nothing else, and fails without it. The delivery to the App Store enters appstore, which holds the token of the App Store and nothing else. Register the app signs the app id in a job in signing and hands the signature and the certificate, neither of them secret, to a job in appstore that posts them.

    release["`*Release*: no environment, passes the build **APP_PRIVATE_KEY** alone`"]
    build["`*the build* in **signing**: signs the app with the key, fails without it`"]
    deliver["`*the delivery* in **appstore**: posts the signed package with the token`"]
    sign["`*Register the app, sign* in **signing**: checks the key against the certificate and signs the app id`"]
    register["`*Register the app, register* in **appstore**: posts the certificate and the signature with the token`"]
    store["The Nextcloud App Store"]

    release --> build --> deliver --> store
    sign -->|"the certificate and the signature, no secret"| register --> store

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class release,build,deliver,sign,register bot
    class store done
